# snapshot-edit-deny's cells. Every start of the hook is one end-to-end cell, tagged at its start by drive()
# (FXCELL=<tag>.<unit>). A PreToolUse hook IS its wiring -- a stdin payload, an exit code and a decision on stdout --
# so no sourced call reproduces it.
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.edit why=an Edit of the snapshot is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.write why=a Write of the snapshot is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.multi why=a MultiEdit of the snapshot is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.nbedit why=a NotebookEdit naming the snapshot in notebook_path is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.statedir why=a snapshot outside _bmad-output is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.bare why=the bare relative snapshot path is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.case why=a case variant of the snapshot is denied
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.hist why=the history file passes
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.bak why=a .bak copy passes
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.notes why=another directory's notes.md passes
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.xpipe why=xpipeline-snapshot.md passes
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh ship.nbfile why=a NotebookEdit carrying file_path passes
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh control.edit why=the unmutated copy through the mutant harness
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh m-nodeny.edit why=mutant m-nodeny, its deciding unit
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh m-nodeny.hist why=mutant m-nodeny, its twin
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh m-nowrite.write why=mutant m-nowrite, its deciding unit
e2e core/hooks/ai-dlc-snapshot-edit-deny.sh m-nowrite.edit why=mutant m-nowrite, its twin
